  "bodyHash": "fa9de112eb30b56e",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">此模組為遊戲新增了可馴服的豪豬！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">預設情況下，它們會生成於森林生態域中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">（在 Forge 中，您可以透過編輯 data -&gt; biome tags 與 biome modifier 資料夾中的 JSON 檔案，或使用資源包來變更此設定及其他生成設定</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">而在 Fabric 中則有專屬的設定檔可供調整）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">當攻擊者靠近豪豬時，會被其刺針扎傷。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">餵食蘋果即可馴服牠們，並使用甜莓進行繁殖。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">甜莓也能稍微恢復牠的生命值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">預設已提升其護甲值以增強耐久性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模組目前支援</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge 26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric 26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.x</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>自 1.0.4 版本起，豪豬改為夜行性（若未馴服，白天會進入睡眠狀態）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1056/494/javaw_z5vm0ui7ko.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"841\" height=\"732\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#f00\"><strong>若您需要的模組版本不同，請發送私人訊息給我</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>安裝此模組前需先安裝 AQUARIUSLIBS</strong></a></span></p>",
